<!--
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

    PixelExperience-Reborn Android 17: framework compatibility matrix extension
    for the Qualcomm vendor HALs of vintf/manifest.xml. Android 17 checks every
    instance of the device manifest against the framework matrices; the
    vendor.* and com.qualcomm.* HALs are not in the AOSP ones. Versions and
    instances are exactly those of the manifest.
-->
